WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.956 --> 00:00:16.042
"I have to to Metro City Park," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:16.062 --> 00:00:18.884
"Someone just attacked workers there."

3
00:00:20.845 --> 00:00:21.925
Roxy looked at her friends.

4
00:00:21.945 --> 00:00:23.886
"I'll be right back.

5
00:00:24.386 --> 00:00:27.428
I'm going to go, um, look at the owls again!"

6
00:00:31.052 --> 00:00:34.134
When Roxy landed in Metro City Park, she saw some workers.

7
00:00:34.954 --> 00:00:36.856
Broken saws and rope lay in the grass.

8
00:00:37.656 --> 00:00:39.337
A bucket truck was parked nearby.

9
00:00:40.338 --> 00:00:42.899
Its tires were flat, and its windows were smashed.

10
00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:44.800
Its crane was bent.

11
00:00:44.821 --> 00:00:47.882
"Wow," Roxy thought.

12
00:00:47.902 --> 00:00:50.324
"Why would someone do this?"

13
00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.646
Detective Smith was looking at some trees.

14
00:00:55.147 --> 00:00:56.728
Vultures were perched on the branches.

15
00:00:59.808 --> 00:01:02.069
"So, Detective," Roxy said with a grin.

16
00:01:02.089 --> 00:01:05.630
"Do the vultures know who attacked the workers?"

17
00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:07.690
Detective Smith groaned.

18
00:01:08.511 --> 00:01:10.451
"Very funny, Rocket Girl.

19
00:01:10.711 --> 00:01:13.252
Those are the trees the workers were going to cut down."

20
00:01:14.252 --> 00:01:16.613
A worker walked over to Detective Smith and Roxy.

21
00:01:16.633 --> 00:01:19.234
"I'm Earl," he said.

22
00:01:19.254 --> 00:01:20.934
"I'm the supervisor."

23
00:01:20.954 --> 00:01:23.015
"What happened here?"

24
00:01:23.335 --> 00:01:24.335
Detective Smith asked.

25
00:01:25.316 --> 00:01:26.416
Earl scratched his head.

26
00:01:28.948 --> 00:01:31.489
"Well, we came here to cut down those trees.

27
00:01:32.189 --> 00:01:34.069
But then a flying person attacked us."

28
00:01:34.089 --> 00:01:38.811
"Why were you cutting down the trees?"

29
00:01:39.171 --> 00:01:39.871
Roxy asked.

30
00:01:39.891 --> 00:01:43.092
"Vultures perch in them," Earl said.

31
00:01:43.112 --> 00:01:46.413
"Residents near here don't want vultures around."

32
00:01:47.713 --> 00:01:48.854
Roxy was confused.

33
00:01:48.874 --> 00:01:51.054
"What's wrong with vultures?

34
00:01:51.294 --> 00:01:52.235
They're just birds."

35
00:01:53.535 --> 00:01:54.195
Earl shrugged.

36
00:01:54.215 --> 00:01:57.156
"The residents say the vultures are creepy."

37
00:02:00.388 --> 00:02:02.070
"Um, can someone help me?"

38
00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:03.551
a voice said suddenly.

39
00:02:04.332 --> 00:02:05.132
Roxy looked up.

40
00:02:06.774 --> 00:02:08.175
A worker was high up in a tree.

41
00:02:10.197 --> 00:02:11.718
A rope lay in the grass below him.

42
00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:15.321
"Carl!" Earl said.

43
00:02:15.341 --> 00:02:17.382
"I forgot you were up there!"

44
00:02:18.684 --> 00:02:19.684
Carl looked annoyed.

45
00:02:19.704 --> 00:02:22.287
"That bird villain snapped my rope.

46
00:02:22.607 --> 00:02:23.788
Now I'm stuck up here!"

47
00:02:23.808 --> 00:02:25.629
"Hold on!"

48
00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.592
Roxy flew up to Carl and brought him safely down.

49
00:02:31.628 --> 00:02:34.371
"You're the best, Rocket Girl," Carl said.

50
00:02:35.992 --> 00:02:37.654
Detective Smith took out his notepad.

51
00:02:37.674 --> 00:02:40.296
"Can either of you describe the villain?"

52
00:02:41.497 --> 00:02:42.077
Earl nodded.

53
00:02:42.098 --> 00:02:44.700
"Yeah. She looked like a hawk.

54
00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:49.504
She had really big wings and a hawk mask."

55
00:02:49.604 --> 00:02:50.525
Carl nodded too.

56
00:02:50.545 --> 00:02:53.708
"She called herself Thunderhawk."

57
00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.032
Detective Smith looked thoughtful.

58
00:02:58.936 --> 00:03:02.339
"This must be the same person who attacked people at the roof party.

59
00:03:02.679 --> 00:03:03.860
The party was over there."

60
00:03:04.821 --> 00:03:06.202
He pointed at a nearby building.

61
00:03:06.222 --> 00:03:11.305
"The residents said they had just gotten rid of a hawk's nest."

62
00:03:11.325 --> 00:03:14.068
"Hmm," Roxy thought.

63
00:03:14.088 --> 00:03:17.650
"Robin cares about birds, especially raptors.

64
00:03:18.011 --> 00:03:20.052
Maybe she knows who Thunderhawk is."

65
00:03:24.135 --> 00:03:24.916
She called Terrell.

66
00:03:28.268 --> 00:03:30.091
"Hey, Rocket Girl," Terrell said.

67
00:03:30.111 --> 00:03:34.057
"I'm coming back to the Raptor Center, Terrell," Roxy said.

68
00:03:34.077 --> 00:03:36.320
"I need to talk to Robin."

69
00:03:37.802 --> 00:03:39.585
"Robin's not here," Terrell said.

70
00:03:39.605 --> 00:03:41.588
"She never came back."
